  message: "9 of 21 WARN repos are false positives from diagnostic thresholds. HIGH_TIER1_PCT (95%) flags pure first-party repos (ArkLib, circom, plonky2, ix). HIGH_SLICE_COVERAGE_PCT (10%) flags small focused repos (incrementalmerkletree, jmt, pasta_curves). HIGH_AVG_SLICE_NODES (500) flags highly-connected Agda repos (bft-consensus-agda, crypto-agda). Proposals: raise TIER1 to 98%, SLICE_COVERAGE to 20%, AVG_SLICE upper to 2000. Needs human review because these affect quality evaluation standards."  # 933b
